      "title": "Worldwide Historical Child Stunting Dataset",
      "description": "This dataset presents child stunting rates from the systematic review of historical child growth studies performed by Schneider et al. (2026). \"The Decline of Child Stunting in 122 Countries: A Systematic Review of Child Growth Studies Since the Nineteenth Century\".\n\nThe article is a systematic review of 923 child growth studies covering 122 countries from 1814 to 2016, reconstructing historical rates of child stunting before 1990.",
